        <h1 class="post-detail__title">Tin Cup by the Numbers</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/49322.webp" alt="Tin Cup by the Numbers" loading="lazy">
        </div>

        <div class="post-detail__content">
          <p>As the busy summer season draws to a close, we are thrilled to officially report to you regarding the success of the 8th Annual Tin Cup Challenge. We once again marvel at our community&#8217;s generosity in action, as together we raised an astounding $1,157,601 benefitting Teton Valley nonprofits. But that’s only one of the many numbers worth celebrating.</p>
<p>Because of our community’s spirit of generosity, the 8<sup>th</sup> Annual Tin Cup Challenge is another resounding success in every aspect; including the extraordinary commitment of volunteers who logged over 1,000 hours and the $800,000+ raised by participating nonprofits.  Simply put, Teton Valley is filled with highly generous people who give freely of their time, talent and treasure.  We at the Community Foundation are overwhelmingly grateful for your generosity in action and we hope you will join us in celebrating our community’s story of success as told by the numbers…</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
